{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e16-scene-08",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "从小到大的宝书  (A Treasured Book and Loyal Walkout)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "kaiwen": "凯文"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Bu Xiaogu lends Chun Yuqiao the favourite book that always cheered her up since childhood, then steps into the corridor where Xingzi and Kaiwen tell her they are walking off tonight's broadcast out of loyalty to their boss. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我跟您说啊，我这本书可是我从小到大的宝书。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不管有多难过的事，只要我一看这本书，我一下子就挺过来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你说是不是很厉害？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我出去看看，千万别客气，有事就叫我啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大怎么样了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好多了，有点精神了。怎么了，开会开得不愉快啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "他们准备绕开总编室，老大被排挤出魅力远航了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他们怎么能这么做？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "最重要的是董事长居然默认了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我们俩准备退出节目制作，包括今天晚上直播，不管了，跟老大共进退。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你怎么想？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我跟您说啊，我这本书可是我从小到大的宝书。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let me tell you, this book has been my absolute treasure ever since I was little.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不管有多难过的事，只要我一看这本书，我一下子就挺过来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No matter how sad things got, the moment I read this book I pulled right through.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你说是不是很厉害？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Would you not say that is pretty amazing?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我出去看看，千万别客气，有事就叫我啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will step outside to check on things—do not be polite, call me right away if you need anything.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大怎么样了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How is the boss doing?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好多了，有点精神了。怎么了，开会开得不愉快啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Much better—he has some energy back. What happened, did the meeting go badly?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "他们准备绕开总编室，老大被排挤出魅力远航了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They plan to bypass the chief editor's office—the boss has been pushed out of his own show.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他们怎么能这么做？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How could they possibly do that?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "最重要的是董事长居然默认了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Worst of all, the chairwoman actually went along with it in silence.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我们俩准备退出节目制作，包括今天晚上直播，不管了，跟老大共进退。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The two of us are stepping down from production, including tonight's live finale—we stand or fall with our boss.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你怎么想？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What do you think?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我跟您说啊，我这本书可是我从小到大的宝书。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不管有多难过的事，只要我一看这本书，我一下子就挺过来了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
