      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "好多了，有点精神了。怎么了，开会开得不愉快啊？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "他们准备绕开总编室，老大被排挤出魅力远航了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他们怎么能这么做？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "最重要的是董事长居然默认了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我们俩准备退出节目制作，包括今天晚上直播，不管了，跟老大共进退。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你怎么想？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "With the chief editor's team stepping back in protest, rival executives take over the control booth just as storm clouds gather outside. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
